@title F2 rename selects the old tag, so typing replaces it
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Click test C-08: F2 on a device opened the tag field with the old tag unselected and typing appended ("-K1K99"). The tag is selected now.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click 352 229
wait 8
key F2
wait 8
text K99
wait 6
shot f2-typed
expect_not "K1K99"
expect "K99"
